lore = "The civilization tier (X3): fast-forward folds the player-choice ledger at sky-day cadence. A day of drift is a rounding error here; what players chose is the only state worth folding, and the Concord Chronicle is already its day-scale ledger. Cosmic calibration declared: SI-exact c (299792458 m/s) and the measured expansion rate H0 (67.4 km/s/Mpc, Planck 2018) -- consumed when the ladder reaches them, never hard-coded."
